    "Scoped deletion, field-presence handling, runtime field authority, Starport adoption, and released-pair acceptance remain open.",
    "No primary acceptance credit. All 50 primary cases remain UNVERIFIED.",
    "Required publication review remains open. The shared helper remains unchanged at 512000 bytes. No code push or native CI dispatch occurred."
  ],
